m.\nKnown sanity check: current lastWatermarkUrl /consequence-31-rh-50-fde.html matches the CURRENT first product of /archery/bows/?sort=newest, proving T1 watermark mechanism is semantically correct.\nOn-page `NN Products` count text matches walked count exactly for every verified leaf (shotguns 27/27, centerfire-rifles 52/52, riflescopes 44/44, bows 145/145, calls 24/24). No drift. Production buildPaginatedUrl suffix-replace fallback at catalog-crawler.ts:127-136 handles baseUrls ending in '/' correctly by appending the template. | 2026-04-12 re-audit: Mistake 26 confirmed (same as sites 9/11). paginationPattern was BROKEN (.html match never hits on / URLs). Fixed with sortParam+limit=100 anchor. ?limit=100 reduces pages 8x. expectedProductCount 2716→1669 (prior inflated from sitemap). 4 zero-product catalogUrls removed.",
